WEBVTT

00:00:06.061 --> 00:00:11.322
Click Account menu.

00:00:11.572 --> 00:00:16.832
Click My account.

00:00:17.082 --> 00:00:22.341
Scroll to Password.

00:00:22.591 --> 00:00:28.591
Type "river" in the New password box.

00:00:30.281 --> 00:00:36.281
Scroll to Two step sign in.

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:42.980
Click Make new recovery codes.

00:00:43.779 --> 00:00:49.779
Check that Your old codes
stop working. is in the box.

00:00:53.632 --> 00:00:58.891
Click Cancel.

00:00:59.141 --> 00:01:05.141
Scroll to Where you are signed in.
